# Base URL of the Nature Commons API. Not secret; fine to commit. Deliberately
# 127.0.0.1, not localhost: on this dev machine, IPv6 loopback (::1) connections hang
# for ~200ms-2s before falling back to IPv4 (confirmed via `curl -6` — Windows Firewall/
# Docker Desktop networking appears to silently drop them rather than refuse outright),
# and both curl and every browser's "happy eyeballs" dual-stack resolution race pay part
# of that tax on *every single request* to a bare "localhost" URL. That was the single
# biggest contributor to "everything feels slow" locally - not app code, not data volume
# - see Manager/log/2026-09-20-performance-investigation.md. Swap to a real hostname for
# any non-local deployment; this only matters for this loopback case.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
